<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><o:p>This email is to be used for the purpose of sending signed addendum form to Collections team for changes in the payment terms for an existing customer.</o:p></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><font face="Verdana"><font size="2"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"></span></font></font>&nbsp;</p><p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><u style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Details of Customer&nbsp;<br></u><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Account Name:&nbsp;</strong><font face="Verdana, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!OrderC__c.Account__c}</span></font><br><strong style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">Order&nbsp;Number:&nbsp;</strong><font face="Verdana, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 13px;">{!OrderC__c.OrderNumber__c}</span></font><br><br></p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;"><p style="margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><br></span></p><p><font color="#ff6633">Please provide the following information:</font><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><strong><br>New Payment Terms:</strong><br></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><strong>Reason for Addendum:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p></span><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt;"></span><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><strong><span style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><font face="Verdana" size="2"></font></span></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"><strong><font color="#ff6633"><u>Note:</u></font><font color="#000000">&nbsp;</font></strong>For quick processing, please ensure the&nbsp;<em>signed addendum form</em>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>approval email</em>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<em>attached on the respective Orders &gt; Attachment view in Karma</em>&nbsp;as explained in the process document.</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;">Regards,</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in 0in 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;"></span>&nbsp;</p>]]></td>
</tr>
